    "harm": "long-term illness",
    "drive": "mixed-age choir community",
    "integration": "performing despite limits",
    "summary": "The recording of the choir's winter concert arrived this week, with my first solo verse in it. A long-term health condition has limited my breath and stamina for years, and the weekly rehearsals with people of every age keep both lungs and mood working. Standing at the front of the hall and hearing the room go quiet brought back the person who used to perform without a second thought. What started as a neighbour's nudge has become the one hour a week that is only mine.",
